                                                <span style="font-size: 11.5px; color: #6D28D9;">Interactive card entry screen with sandbox verification</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <span style="background: #10B981; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 9999px;">
                                            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> SANDBOX LIVE
                                        </span>
                                    </div>

                                    <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DDD6FE; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
